            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.78</h2><ul><li>Adds the new Companion Realtime Voice streaming WebSocket transport used by VoiceClaw Realtime on iOS.</li><li>Keeps the legacy Companion turn upload path available for fallback and A/B testing.</li><li>Preserves Cerebras, GPT-5.5, and local Qwen middle-brain options for Companion Realtime Voice.</li></ul>
]]></description>
