            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.77</h2><ul><li>Improves Companion Realtime Voice text-message handoffs so complete requests like “Text Sam that I am late” produce a Messages draft with the intended recipient and body.</li><li>Asks for the missing recipient when the user requests a text draft without saying who it is for, instead of sending a malformed iPhone action.</li><li>Keeps the placeholder/no-speech filtering and Cerebras/local middle-brain support from the prior release.</li></ul>
]]></description>
